<title>FRANCE: France to sell 300 to 500 mln Ffr of OATs Thursday.</title>
<headline>France to sell 300 to 500 mln Ffr of OATs Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>France is to offer between 300 and 500 million Ecu of government bonds (OATs) at its next scheduled auction on March 13, the Treasury said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Treasury will offer the current 10-year benchmark OAT, the 5.50 percent April 25 2007 OAT, with a payment date of March 27, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
